    "id": "p43-q4-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "4",
    "prompt": "For $f(x)=\\dfrac{x^2}{168}$ defined on $2\\le x\\le8$, find the following. Give answers to 2 decimal places.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p43-q4-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "the median",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$6.38$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}F(x)&=\\int_2^x\\frac{t^2}{168}\\,dt\\\\&=\\left[\\frac{t^3}{504}\\right]_2^x\\\\&=\\frac{x^3-8}{504}\\\\F(m)&=0.5\\\\\\frac{m^3-8}{504}&=0.5\\\\m^3&=260\\\\m&=\\sqrt[3]{260}\\\\m&\\approx6.38\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 39
      },
      {
        "id": "p43-q4-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "the 1st quartile",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$5.12$",
          "worked": "For $2\\le x\\le8$, $F(x)=\\displaystyle\\int_2^x\\frac{t^2}{168}\\,dt=\\frac{x^3-8}{504}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}F(Q_1)&=0.25\\\\\\frac{Q_1^3-8}{504}&=0.25\\\\Q_1^3&=134\\\\Q_1&=\\sqrt[3]{134}\\\\Q_1&\\approx5.12\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 33
      },
      {
